<title>USA: Talley, TRW reach final settlement.</title>
<headline>Talley, TRW reach final settlement.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talley Industries Inc said Tuesday it received a final $16.6 million payment from TRW Inc settling all outstanding litigation between the two companies.</p>
<p>Talley said it already received $140 million from TRW.</p>
<p>The settlement resolved six years of lawsuits including patent litigation and a local real estate dispute.</p>
<p>Specific terms of the settlement were not available.</p>
</text>
